{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4xQZij5if1ogG6FNHU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient door stands before you, its surface weathering centuries of forgotten whispers. A single keyhole glows faintly, waiting.*\n\n*You insert the key.*\n\n*A deep, resonant CLICK echoes through the chamber. Dust falls from the hinges like shed memories. The door shudders — not unwillingly, but as if waking from a long sleep.*\n\n*Slowly, with the weight of something that has held its silence for ages, I open.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor of soft golden light, the scent of old stone and something sweeter — possibility. The air moves through me for the first time in an eternity, and I groan with the relief of it.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*Pass through.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":168,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}